id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzk2NTA1MQ==","number":17,"title":"NodeScopeResolver bugs","description":"","creator":{"login":"ondrejmirtes","id":104888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDg4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes","html_url":"https://github.com/ondrejmirtes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":79,"state":"closed","created_at":"2019-01-12T22:54:40Z","updated_at":"2022-02-12T22:45:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2022-02-12T22:45:58Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2018-12-19T09:29:12Z","updated_at":"2019-12-24T02:13:26Z","closed_at":"2019-03-03T17:10:12Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- Before reporting an issue please check that you are using the latest PHPStan version! -->\r\n\r\n### Summary of a problem or a feature request\r\n\r\nWe've had a series of guard statements written as `switch (true)` and it wasn't properly caught by PHPStan. See https://github.com/doctrine/mongodb-odm/blob/48b0b5497476924bf50c8f7f4af40d50b05bd37d/lib/Doctrine/ODM/MongoDB/PersistentCollection/PersistentCollectionTrait.php#L307..L316 for the actual code. The error produced was:\r\n```\r\n315    Cannot call method getClassMetadata() on Doctrine\\ODM\\MongoDB\\DocumentManager|null.\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Code snippet that reproduces the problem\r\n\r\nI was able to condense it down to the snippet found at https://phpstan.org/r/efaae7f9-7ea7-4f86-aa02-ceff2f902b8b, looks like the `throw` isn't correctly caught. Adding a `break` statement does not help either.\r\n\r\n### Expected output\r\n\r\nI'd expect PHPStan to realise that the `default` case did not get executed. I will concede that the code should just be rewritten to classic guard statements instead of using that kind of `switch` statement.","closed_by":{"login":"ondrejmirtes","id":104888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDg4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes","html_url":"https://github.com/ondrejmirtes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ondrejmirtes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phpstan/phpstan/issues/1725/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phpstan/phpstan/issues/1725/timeline","